WEBVTT

00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:02.775
Step 1: Navigate to the Todoist-clone app

00:00:01.748 --> 00:00:03.748
Step 2: Click the 'Search' item in the sidebar primary navigation

00:00:02.487 --> 00:00:04.487
Step 3: Type the uppercase query 'BLOG' into the Search tasks input

00:00:04.116 --> 00:00:06.116
Step 4: Select all text already in the focused Search tasks input

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.500
Step 5: Delete the selected text so the Search tasks input is empty before the next query

00:00:05.127 --> 00:00:07.268
Step 6: Replace the query with the partial substring 'tea'

00:00:07.268 --> 00:00:09.268
Step 7: Select all text already in the focused Search tasks input

00:00:07.405 --> 00:00:09.405
Step 8: Delete the selected text so the Search tasks input is empty before the next query

00:00:08.038 --> 00:00:10.038
Step 9: Replace the query with the multi-word query 'set up ci'

00:00:09.831 --> 00:00:11.831
Step 10: Select all text already in the focused Search tasks input

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:12.190
Step 11: Delete the selected text so the Search tasks input is empty before the next query

00:00:10.805 --> 00:00:12.805
Step 12: Replace the query with 'zzqqxx' which matches no task

00:00:12.317 --> 00:00:14.317
Step 13: Select all text already in the focused Search tasks input

00:00:12.751 --> 00:00:14.751
Step 14: Delete the selected text so the Search tasks input is empty before the next query

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.654
Step 15: Replace the query with 'review' to confirm the list recovers after a no-match query
